      "text": "Nobody argues with grey boxes for long, which is exactly why you want them.\nSettle what the screens are and in what order, while that is still free.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nobody argues with grey boxes for long, which is exactly why you want them.\nSettle what the screens are and in what order, while that is still free.",
